so whenever I can have
it, I'm gonna have it,

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.830
and then when I don't, it will
be less amount of suffering

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.670
than if I never brought it
'cause I'm not gonna train myself

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:26.750
to not need the pillow, forget about it.

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.310
- You should be like Jim Aycock

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.490
and just sleep with no pillow.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:31.450
Do you know that's what he did?

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:33.420
- 102 years old and he golfs every day.

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:34.960
- Yeah.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:35.950
- Sleeps with no pillow.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:39.468
- And he will tell you that's
one of the keys to life.

00:21:39.468 --> 00:21:40.990
(Link sputters)
Sleeping with no pillow.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:43.860
- Here's the thing with
people who are really old.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.330
They all think they have a key to life

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.520
and it's the genes, man.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:50.010
It's nothing it's like my
key to life is I eat bacon

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:51.810
and ice cream every day and I'm 102.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:54.450
No.

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:57.940
That's just you thumbing your nose at us

00:21:57.940 --> 00:22:00.000
at the rest of the gene pool.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.590
Don't take credit for that
and don't give the credit

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.930
to bacon and ice cream.

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:05.920
- But sleeping without a
pillow, that's pretty badass.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:06.753
- Pillah.
- Let's talk about--

00:22:06.753 --> 00:22:09.870
